            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0597" n="479" xml:id="pg479"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.9331/71: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-27T11:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>245. 1. Full powers have been issued to you.</p>
                <p>2. Legation’s telegram 574, July 27, 10 a.m. has been received. Announcement will
                    be made here today of signature and text of the treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
